plied in order\n  - `ExpectedFiles` (map[string][]byte): files created by the test that should be verified\n\n- **RunDiffTests()** function signature:\n  ```go\n  func RunDiffTests(t *testing.T, goBinary, refBinary string, tests []DiffTest)\n  ```\n\n- **NormalizeFunc** type: `func([]byte) []byte` - transformations applied to stdout/stderr before comparison\n\n- **TimestampNormalizer**: a built-in NormalizeFunc that replaces common timestamp patterns with `<TIMESTAMP>`\n\nThe framework runs both binaries with identical inputs, applies normalizers to both outputs, and compares stdout, stderr, and exit codes for divergence."}],"totalDurationMs":17856,"totalTokens":29770,"totalToolUseCount":7,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7099,"cache_read_input_tokens":21852,"output_tokens":812,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7099},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":7,"output_tokens":812,"cache_read_input_tokens":21852,"cache_creation_input_tokens":7099,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":7099,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":3,"searchCount":3,"bashCount":1,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
